    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it wasn't just one time. it's happened a few times now where my body reacts a split second before the candle moves on my chart. like a literal physical sensation in my chest. i've been reading about how much data is being traded now—it's all just signals, right? if i'm part of this massive bio-network of traders, couldn't my own nervous system be picking up on the aggregate frequency of the market movement? like i'm subconsciously syncing up with the volatility?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
